# Rules push destination

When making or updating files under `.cursor/rules/`, push those rule changes to:

`git@github.com:JoshFialkoff/Agile-Cursor.git`

If there is a prior conflicting destination for rule pushes, treat this destination as the current source of truth.

Never push rule changes to:

`https://github.com/JoshFialkoff/Assistedly.ai/tree/cursor/agent-workspace-rule-bf03`
